{"name":"lab-business-card","kind":"lab","layout":"link","multifile":true,"editableBoundaries":false,"helpCategory":"HTML-CSS","challenges":[{"id":"6690e10ebe2181212abc9652","title":"Design a Business Card","dashedName":"design-a-business-card","challengeType":25,"demoType":"onClick","description":[{"t":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":["Objective:"]}," Fulfill the user stories below and get all the tests to pass to complete the lab."]},{"t":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":["User Stories:"]}]},{"t":"ol","items":[[{"t":"p","c":["You should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," with a ",{"t":"code","v":"class"}," attribute with a value of ",{"t":"code","v":"business-card"}," that will contain all the other elements. "]}],[{"t":"p","c":["Inside the ",{"t":"code","v":".business-card"}," element, there should be an ",{"t":"code","v":"img"}," element with a ",{"t":"code","v":"class"}," attribute with a value of ",{"t":"code","v":"profile-image"},". You can set the image source to ",{"t":"code","v":"https://cdn.freecodecamp.org/curriculum/labs/flower.jpg"}," if you like. There should be an ",{"t":"code","v":"alt"}," with a meaningful description."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["Inside the ",{"t":"code","v":".business-card"}," element, after the ",{"t":"code","v":"img"}," element, you should have three ",{"t":"code","v":"p"}," elements with a ",{"t":"code","v":"class"}," attribute that has, respectively, a value of ",{"t":"code","v":"full-name"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"designation"},", and ",{"t":"code","v":"company"},"."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["The first ",{"t":"code","v":"p"}," element should contain your name."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["The second ",{"t":"code","v":"p"}," element should contain your designation."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["The third ",{"t":"code","v":"p"}," element should have your company name. "]}],[{"t":"p","c":["There should be an ",{"t":"code","v":"hr"}," element below the third ",{"t":"code","v":"p"}," element."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["After the ",{"t":"code","v":"hr"}," element, there should be two ",{"t":"code","v":"p"}," elements. In the first ",{"t":"code","v":"p"}," element, you should have an email address as the text. In the second ",{"t":"code","v":"p"}," element, the text should be a phone number."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["After the two ",{"t":"code","v":"p"}," elements, there should be an ",{"t":"code","v":"a"}," element with a class of ",{"t":"code","v":"portfolio-link"},", the text ",{"t":"code","v":"Portfolio"},", and it should link to a valid URL."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["There should be an ",{"t":"code","v":"hr"}," element after the ",{"t":"code","v":"a"}," element containing the portfolio link."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["You should have another ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," element with a ",{"t":"code","v":"class"}," attribute with a value of ",{"t":"code","v":"social-media"},". Within this element, there should be an ",{"t":"code","v":"h2"}," element with the text ",{"t":"code","v":"Connect with me"},". "]}],[{"t":"p","c":["Inside the ",{"t":"code","v":".social-media"}," elements, there should be three ",{"t":"code","v":"a"}," elements. The ",{"t":"code","v":"a"}," elements should have the text ",{"t":"code","v":"Twitter"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"LinkedIn"}," and ",{"t":"code","v":"GitHub"}," respectively with links to valid websites."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["You should link the style sheet ",{"t":"code","v":"styles.css"}," using the ",{"t":"code","v":"link"}," tag in the ",{"t":"code","v":"head"}," section of the HTML file."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["Your page background should be ",{"t":"code","v":"rosybrown"},". The overall font should be ",{"t":"code","v":"Arial"},", with a fallback of ",{"t":"code","v":"sans-serif"},".   "]}],[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".business-card"}," selector should have properties to set the element as ",{"t":"code","v":"300px"}," wide and a background color of your choice. Also you should set a ",{"t":"code","v":"padding"}," of ",{"t":"code","v":"20px"}," all around and a top ",{"t":"code","v":"margin"}," of ",{"t":"code","v":"100px"},". The text should be center aligned and the font size should be ",{"t":"code","v":"16px"},". The left and right margins should be set to ",{"t":"code","v":"auto"},"."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".profile-image"}," selector should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"max-width"}," property with a value of ",{"t":"code","v":"100%"},"."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["All of the ",{"t":"code","v":"p"}," elements should have a top and bottom ",{"t":"code","v":"margin"}," of ",{"t":"code","v":"5px"},"."]}],[{"t":"p","c":["All links on the page should not be underlined."]}]]}],"hints":[{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["You should have one main ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," with a ",{"t":"code","v":"class"}," attribute with a value of ",{"t":"code","v":"business-card"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(document.querySelector('div')?.getAttribute('class'), 'business-card');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["Inside the ",{"t":"code","v":".business-card"}," element, there should be an ",{"t":"code","v":"img"}," element with a ",{"t":"code","v":"class"}," attribute with a value of",{"t":"code","v":"profile-image"},"."]}],"test":"assert.exists(document.querySelector('img.profile-image'));"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The image source should be set to a valid image."]}],"test":"assert.isAbove(document.querySelector('.profile-image')?.getAttribute('src')?.length, 0);"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":"alt"}," attribute of the image should be set to a meaningful description."]}],"test":"assert.isAbove(document.querySelector('img')?.alt.length, 0);"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["Inside the ",{"t":"code","v":".business-card"}," element, after the ",{"t":"code","v":"img"}," element, there should be a ",{"t":"code","v":"p"}," element with a ",{"t":"code","v":"class"}," attribute with a value of ",{"t":"code","v":"full-name"},"."]}],"test":"assert.exists(document.querySelector('div.business-card p.full-name'));"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["After the ",{"t":"code","v":".full-name"}," element, there should be a ",{"t":